        <activityName xml:lang="en">Use of wireless IP access network per hour</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Use of wireless IP access network per hour
The data set represents the mix of wireless networks in Switzerland; UUID: 6914b423-73dd-3e72-be77-bda95980c3d6
The datasets represents the split of 2-4G and 5G networks in Switzerland for the year 2020, based on information from Swisscom and study of Bieser et al 2021. The functional unit = 1 GB.
Location: Data for Swiss networks
Technology: The mix of Swiss access transmission network, wireless. 2-4G and 5G technologies are considered.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6914b423-73dd-3e72-be77-bda95980c3d6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
